Layers extending `GridLayer` shall reimplement the following method:

@method createTile(coords: Object, done?: Function): HTMLElement

Called only internally, this method must be overridden by classes extending `GridLayer`. It returns the `HTMLElement` corresponding to the specified `coords`. If the `done` callback is specified, it must be called when the tile has finished loading and drawing.

